  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability with ki reinforces the vitality of your body.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you take this feat, you gain 2 hit points for each ki feat you have (including this one). Whenever you take a new ki feat, you gain 2 more hit points. In addition, while ki focused, you gain +4 on saving throws against death effects as ki, the energy of life, infuses your body.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc103\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
